#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:5 c72af9f65ebb4b34adf9994dbecd5917
msgid "Independent Watchdog and Crash Dump"
msgstr "独立看门狗与崩溃转储"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:7 4a2459cc3bce4215a0739829e6374fdd
msgid ""
"In ArduPilot 4.0 and later firmware revisions, the autopilot cpu's internal "
"independent watchdog has been enabled. It can be disabled (NOT recommended!)"
" by setting :ref:`BRD_OPTIONS<BRD_OPTIONS>` = 0. The cpu will be reset if a "
"peripheral or code takes too long to complete its scheduled software thread "
"or \"hangs\" the cpu, and will restart the cpu. This may or may not save the"
" vehicle if in flight or motion."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 4.0 及更高版本固件中，飞控 CPU 的内部独立看门狗已启用。可通过设置 "
":ref:`BRD_OPTIONS<BRD_OPTIONS>` = 0 "
"将其禁用（不推荐！）。如果某个外设或代码执行其计划软件线程时耗时过长或「卡住」CPU，CPU "
"将会复位并重启。这在飞行或运动中可能会也可能不会挽救飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:9 49350cc4dcba474f9560018d7a86ee45
msgid ""
"In the case of a \"HARD FAULT\" (illegal instruction, out of bounds memory "
"access,etc.) instead of a delay in completing a thread in timely manner, "
"before resetting, the code will attempt to write a file called "
"crash_dump.bin in the flash capturing the cpu state and registers for later "
"analysis (See section below for more details). A \"HARD FAULT\" is extremely"
" serious and should be reported to ArduPilot. The vehicle is probably not "
"safe to fly until the cause is resolved."
msgstr ""
"发生「硬件故障」（非法指令、内存越界访问等）时，而非线程超时延迟，代码在复位前将尝试在闪存中写入名为 crash_dump.bin 的文件，记录 CPU"
" 状态和寄存器以供后续分析（详见下节）。「硬件故障」极为严重，应向 ArduPilot 报告。在查明原因之前，该飞行器可能不安全飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:15 24fae813f05742e09e075774987af8a5
msgid "Determining that a Watchdog Reset Occurred"
msgstr "判断是否发生了看门狗复位"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:17 9e482548bd9942a09f5c64f46e5b75d4
msgid ""
"One way is by looking at the dataflash logs. If the log is filtered to show "
"only the \"MSG\" messages it can be seen that some include the word, "
"\"watchdog\". This is a clear indication that the previous log or flight "
"ended with a watchdog reset."
msgstr ""
"一种方法是查看 DataFlash "
"日志。如果过滤日志只显示「MSG」消息，可以看到部分消息包含「watchdog」字样，这清楚表明上一次日志或飞行以看门狗复位结束。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:23 066a3110876a433c966514e1a25baa54
msgid ""
"A WDOG log message should also appear with the following columns that may be"
" useful for developers investigating the cause of the watchdog"
msgstr "WDOG 日志消息中也应包含以下列，可帮助开发者排查看门狗原因"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:25 a6d7d2f621c14ce99061a486a5854121
msgid "Task: The scheduler task number OR"
msgstr "Task：调度器任务编号，或"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:27 71f068217b8349d2a8d1f37b000ec1a4
msgid "-1 if the main loop just received the next IMU sample"
msgstr "-1，表示主循环刚收到下一个 IMU 采样"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:28 4e62fe857d0242ffa16018db9bea891c
msgid "-2 if the fast loop had started"
msgstr "-2，表示快速循环已启动"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:29 c7b5cd46f5b1415fb2a5a76858ff04e9
msgid "-3 if the main loop was waiting for the next IMU sample"
msgstr "-3，表示主循环正在等待下一个 IMU 采样"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:31 894b9b3e220043c19a9c2d89e9ab03fd
msgid "IErr : Mask of Internal Errors"
msgstr "IErr：内部错误掩码"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:32 a988bfd370104a578d239257a282d1fb
msgid "IErrCnt : Internal Error Count"
msgstr "IErrCnt：内部错误计数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:33 a651b5a7d35c407a8cbd81a4884bdf71
msgid "MavMsg : MAVLink message id of last processed message"
msgstr "MavMsg：最后处理的 MAVLink 消息 ID"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:34 a5ed90a87d824c1a88918940a9978f4c
msgid ""
"MavCmd : MAVLink COMMAND_LONG or COMMAND_LONG_INT message's command field "
"from last processed message"
msgstr "MavCmd：最后处理的 MAVLink COMMAND_LONG 或 COMMAND_LONG_INT 消息的指令字段"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:35 176a69beda3d4423933897d9143b8f37
msgid ""
"SemLine : Source code line number if program is waiting for a semaphore or 0"
" if not waiting"
msgstr "SemLine：程序等待信号量时的源码行号，不等待时为 0"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:36 6ec3dfc4d84b4fcead2c63c0cbea5ed3
msgid ""
"FL : Fault Line, the source code line number where the fault occurred.  Note"
" this does not specify the filename but it can still be useful"
msgstr "FL：故障行号，即故障发生处的源码行号。注意不包含文件名，但仍有参考价值"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:37 c62948f675964d0ba5b5dce3ef32e630
msgid ""
"FT : Fault Type (see `FaultType enum in AP_HAL_ChibiOS/system.cpp "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/common/stm32_util.h#L144-L151>`__)"
msgstr ""
"FT：故障类型（参见 `AP_HAL_ChibiOS/system.cpp 中的 FaultType 枚举 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/common/stm32_util.h#L144-L151>`__）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:39 1e5e8a7a84ab45edaa8f118cd25b45d4
msgid "1 = Reset"
msgstr "1 = 复位"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:40 2204df655c4346dd8ef62f819ee30dd8
msgid "2 = Non-Maskable Interrupt (aka NMI)"
msgstr "2 = 不可屏蔽中断（NMI）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:41 46939fc02ebd453b9bdc6f0737cf316d
msgid "3 = Hard Fault (the most common)"
msgstr "3 = 硬件故障（最常见）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:42 af793a5a4ae04ac18420d9b8af24ab27
msgid "4 = Memory Management Fault"
msgstr "4 = 内存管理故障"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:43 daa3f4c5f7814bf898a8de00e9a23762
msgid "5 = Bus Fault"
msgstr "5 = 总线故障"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:44 2709d9676e8f4fe7be789c62e9b0f020
msgid "6 = Usage Fault"
msgstr "6 = 使用故障"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:46 a99192c975e94081b36420800108f0b3
msgid ""
"FA : Fault Address (in memory).  For example this would be 0 in case an "
"attempt was made to read a byte using a nullptr"
msgstr "FA：故障地址（内存中）。例如，若尝试使用空指针读取字节，此值为 0"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:47 419c3bdf742b4df28bbc27b021235dee
msgid ""
"FP : Thread Priority (see list of priorities starting with "
"APM_MONITOR_PRIORITY in `AP_HAL_ChibiOS/Scheduler.h "
"<https://github.com/ardupilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/Scheduler.h#L25>`__)"
msgstr ""
"FP：线程优先级（参见 `AP_HAL_ChibiOS/Scheduler.h "
"<https://github.com/ardupilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/Scheduler.h#L25>`__"
" 中以 APM_MONITOR_PRIORITY 开头的优先级列表）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:48 54e0c3f6c9974a6a9f9cca6974d882cb
msgid ""
"ICSR : Interrupt Control and State Register (see \"ICSR bit assignments\" in"
" ST datasheets)"
msgstr "ICSR：中断控制和状态寄存器（参见 ST 数据手册中的「ICSR 位分配」）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:53 999efa383b254c48b774ad4750ed1439
msgid "CRASH DUMP"
msgstr "崩溃转储"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:55 76c3d520f6914e7ca4701e968847fd56
msgid ""
"On a \"HARD FAULT\", a file will be attempted to be written to the \"@SYS\" "
"flash area as \"crash_dump.bin\" containing needed system state information "
"for later diagnosis. This file can be downloaded using Misssion Planner or "
"other GCS for forwarding to ArduPilot, either by `forum "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/>`__ or :ref:`Discord <ardupilot-discord-"
"server>` post."
msgstr ""
"发生「硬件故障」时，代码将尝试在「@SYS」闪存区域写入名为「crash_dump.bin」的文件，包含后续诊断所需的系统状态信息。该文件可通过 "
"Mission Planner 或其他地面站下载，通过 `论坛 <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/>`__ 或 "
":ref:`Discord <ardupilot-discord-server>` 发帖转交给 ArduPilot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:60 5bdb7a7caa064f2ebebbc6a3d517fcfd
msgid ""
"In addition to the crash_dump.bin file, the preceding dataflash log or the "
"git-hash of the firmware that caused the crash dump should be included in "
"the post of the file."
msgstr "除 crash_dump.bin 文件外，发帖时还应附上崩溃前的 DataFlash 日志或导致崩溃的固件的 git-hash。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:65 995037cf9d86494fbcb8f5911e789918
msgid ""
"As of version 4.5.1, if a crash_dump.bin file has been created, a pre-arm "
"failure will be activated to warn the user of the crash dump so that it may "
"be reported. The pre-arm may be cleared by either re-flashing firmware to "
"the autopilot or by setting the :ref:`ARMING_CRSDP_IGN<ARMING_CRSDP_IGN>` "
"param to 1 (not recommended)."
msgstr ""
"自 4.5.1 版本起，如已创建 crash_dump.bin 文件，将触发解锁前失败告警以提醒用户报告崩溃转储。可通过重新烧录固件或将 "
":ref:`ARMING_CRSDP_IGN<ARMING_CRSDP_IGN>` 参数设置为 1（不推荐）来清除该解锁前检查。"
